{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 564.266,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after I, Nephi, had made an end of teaching my brethren,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.428,
      "end": 9.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "our father, Lehi, also spake many things unto them,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.23,
      "end": 15.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rehearsed unto them, how great things the Lord had done for them in bringing them out of the land of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.412,
      "end": 20.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake unto them concerning their rebellions upon the waters,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 20.586,
      "end": 23.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the mercies of God in sparing their lives,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 23.785,
      "end": 26.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were not swallowed up in the sea.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 27.112,
      "end": 31.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also spake unto them concerning the land of promise,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.332,
      "end": 33.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they had obtained\u2014",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.37,
      "end": 35.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how merciful the Lord had been",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.593,
      "end": 39.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in warning us that we should flee out of the land of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 40.081,
      "end": 41.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For, behold, said he,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 41.84,
      "end": 43.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have seen a vision,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 43.599,
      "end": 46.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in which I know that Jerusalem is destroyed;",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 46.38,
      "end": 49.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had we remained in Jerusalem we should also have perished.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.636,
      "end": 53.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, said he, notwithstanding our afflictions,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 53.788,
      "end": 55.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we have obtained a land of promise,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 56.151,
      "end": 59.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a land which is choice above all other lands;",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.21,
      "end": 62.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a land which the Lord God hath covenanted with me",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 62.919,
      "end": 66.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should be a land for the inheritance of my seed.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 66.303,
      "end": 71.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, the Lord hath covenanted this land unto me and to my children forever,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 71.684,
      "end": 76.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also all those who should be led out of other countries by the hand of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 77.24,
      "end": 83.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I, Lehi, prophesy according to the workings of the Spirit which is in me,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 83.364,
      "end": 85.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there shall none come into this land",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 86.145,
      "end": 89.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save they shall be brought by the hand of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 89.797,
      "end": 95.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, this land is consecrated unto him whom he shall bring.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 95.225,
      "end": 100.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if it so be that they shall serve him according to the commandments which he hath given,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 100.746,
      "end": 103.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it shall be a land of liberty unto them;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 103.666,
      "end": 107.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they shall never be brought down into captivity;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 107.654,
      "end": 110.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if so, it shall be because of iniquity;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 110.667,
      "end": 112.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for if iniquity shall abound",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 113.169,
      "end": 115.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cursed shall be the land for their sakes,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 116.089,
      "end": 119.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but unto the righteous it shall be blessed forever.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 119.834,
      "end": 121.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it is wisdom",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 122.057,
      "end": 127.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that this land should be kept as yet from the knowledge of other nations;",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 127.206,
      "end": 130.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, many nations would overrun the land,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 131.055,
      "end": 134.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there would be no place for an inheritance.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 135.079,
      "end": 138.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I, Lehi, have obtained a promise",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 138.231,
      "end": 144.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that inasmuch as those whom the Lord God shall bring out of the land of Jerusalem shall keep his commandments,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 145.052,
      "end": 147.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall prosper upon the face of this land;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 148.018,
      "end": 151.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be kept from all other nations,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 151.356,
      "end": 154.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may possess this land unto themselves.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 154.647,
      "end": 157.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if it so be that they shall keep his commandments",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 158.031,
      "end": 161.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be blessed upon the face of this land,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 161.555,
      "end": 163.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be none to molest them,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 164.15,
      "end": 167.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor to take away the land of their inheritance;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 167.256,
      "end": 169.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall dwell safely forever.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 170.49,
      "end": 172.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, when the time cometh",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 172.946,
      "end": 175.129,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they shall dwindle in unbelief,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 175.309,
      "end": 179.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after they have received so great blessings from the hand of the Lord\u2014",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 179.436,
      "end": 182.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having a knowledge of the creation of the earth, and all men,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 183.145,
      "end": 187.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "knowing the great and marvelous works of the Lord from the creation of the world;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 187.969,
      "end": 191.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having power given them to do all things by faith;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 191.632,
      "end": 194.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having all the commandments from the beginning,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 194.598,
      "end": 199.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having been brought by his infinite goodness into this precious land of promise\u2014",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 200.165,
      "end": 202.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I say, if the day shall come",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 202.853,
      "end": 205.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they will reject the Holy One of Israel,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 205.959,
      "end": 207.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the true Messiah,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 207.532,
      "end": 209.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their Redeemer and their God,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 209.988,
      "end": 213.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the judgments of him that is just shall rest upon them.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 214.43,
      "end": 216.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, he will bring other nations unto them,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 217.164,
      "end": 219.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will give unto them power,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 219.666,
      "end": 224.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will take away from them the lands of their possessions,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 224.444,
      "end": 227.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will cause them to be scattered and smitten.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 228.328,
      "end": 232.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, as one generation passeth to another there shall be bloodsheds,",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 232.734,
      "end": 235.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great visitations among them;",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 235.422,
      "end": 238.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, my sons, I would that ye would remember;",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 238.713,
      "end": 241.917,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I would that ye would hearken unto my words.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 242.597,
      "end": 244.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that ye would awake;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 244.449,
      "end": 246.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "awake from a deep sleep,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 246.487,
      "end": 248.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even from the sleep of hell,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 248.85,
      "end": 252.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shake off the awful chains by which ye are bound,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 252.234,
      "end": 255.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are the chains which bind the children of men,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 255.386,
      "end": 257.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they are carried away captive",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 257.702,
      "end": 260.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "down to the eternal gulf of misery and woe.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 261.401,
      "end": 263.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Awake! and arise from the dust,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 263.996,
      "end": 266.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hear the words of a trembling parent,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 266.73,
      "end": 270.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose limbs ye must soon lay down in the cold and silent grave,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 270.857,
      "end": 273.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from whence no traveler can return;",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 273.452,
      "end": 276.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a few more days and I go the way of all the earth.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 277.197,
      "end": 280.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the Lord hath redeemed my soul from hell;",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 280.256,
      "end": 282.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have beheld his glory,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 282.34,
      "end": 285.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I am encircled about eternally in the arms of his love.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 286.503,
      "end": 288.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I desire that ye should remember",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 288.819,
      "end": 292.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to observe the statutes and the judgments of the Lord;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 292.436,
      "end": 297.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, this hath been the anxiety of my soul from the beginning.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 298.085,
      "end": 301.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My heart hath been weighed down with sorrow from time to time,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 301.655,
      "end": 303.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have feared,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 303.368,
      "end": 305.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest for the hardness of your hearts",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 305.777,
      "end": 309.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord your God should come out in the fulness of his wrath upon you,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 309.997,
      "end": 312.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye be cut off and destroyed forever;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 313.417,
      "end": 318.572,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Or, that a cursing should come upon you for the space of many generations;",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 318.752,
      "end": 322.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye are visited by sword, and by famine, and are hated,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 322.694,
      "end": 327.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and are led according to the will and captivity of the devil.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 327.693,
      "end": 328.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my sons,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 328.988,
      "end": 331.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that these things might not come upon you,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 331.769,
      "end": 335.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that ye might be a choice and a favored people of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 335.85,
      "end": 337.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, his will be done;",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 338.073,
      "end": 340.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for his ways are righteousness forever.",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 341.261,
      "end": 342.84,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he hath said that:",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 343.02,
      "end": 345.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Inasmuch as ye shall keep my commandments",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 346.079,
      "end": 348.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall prosper in the land;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 348.256,
      "end": 351.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but inasmuch as ye will not keep my commandments",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 351.501,
      "end": 354.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall be cut off from my presence.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 354.735,
      "end": 357.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now that my soul might have joy in you,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 357.469,
      "end": 361.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that my heart might leave this world with gladness because of you,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 361.411,
      "end": 365.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might not be brought down with grief and sorrow to the grave,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 365.956,
      "end": 368.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "arise from the dust, my sons, and be men,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 368.783,
      "end": 373.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be determined in one mind and in one heart, united in all things,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 374.071,
      "end": 376.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may not come down into captivity;",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 377.259,
      "end": 379.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That ye may not be cursed with a sore cursing;",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 380.086,
      "end": 386.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, that ye may not incur the displeasure of a just God upon you, unto the destruction,",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 387.139,
      "end": 390.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the eternal destruction of both soul and body.",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 390.93,
      "end": 392.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Awake, my sons;",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 392.503,
      "end": 394.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "put on the armor of righteousness.",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 395.005,
      "end": 397.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Shake off the chains with which ye are bound,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 397.925,
      "end": 400.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come forth out of obscurity,",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 400.659,
      "end": 402.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and arise from the dust.",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 402.964,
      "end": 405.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Rebel no more against your brother,",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 405.373,
      "end": 407.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose views have been glorious,",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 407.782,
      "end": 412.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who hath kept the commandments from the time that we left Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 412.838,
      "end": 418.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who hath been an instrument in the hands of God, in bringing us forth into the land of promise;",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 419.055,
      "end": 420.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for were it not for him,",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 421.0,
      "end": 424.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we must have perished with hunger in the wilderness;",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 424.291,
      "end": 427.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, ye sought to take away his life;",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 427.35,
      "end": 430.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and he hath suffered much sorrow because of you.",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 431.513,
      "end": 434.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I exceedingly fear and tremble because of you,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 434.665,
      "end": 436.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest he shall suffer again;",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 436.842,
      "end": 438.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, ye have accused him",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 439.112,
      "end": 441.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he sought power and authority over you;",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 441.939,
      "end": 445.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I know that he hath not sought for power nor authority over you,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 446.113,
      "end": 448.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he hath sought the glory of God,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 448.801,
      "end": 450.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your own eternal welfare.",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 451.339,
      "end": 454.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye have murmured because he hath been plain unto you.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 454.584,
      "end": 456.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye say that he hath used sharpness;",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 457.04,
      "end": 459.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye say that he hath been angry with you;",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 459.588,
      "end": 461.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, his sharpness",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 461.626,
      "end": 465.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was the sharpness of the power of the word of God,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 465.289,
      "end": 466.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was in him;",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 466.862,
      "end": 471.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that which ye call anger was the truth, according to that which is in God,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 471.779,
      "end": 473.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he could not restrain,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 473.77,
      "end": 476.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "manifesting boldly concerning your iniquities.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 477.469,
      "end": 480.859,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it must needs be that the power of God must be with him,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 481.039,
      "end": 483.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even unto his commanding you that ye must obey.",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 484.098,
      "end": 486.048,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, it was not he,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 486.228,
      "end": 489.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it was the Spirit of the Lord which was in him,",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 489.473,
      "end": 493.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which opened his mouth to utterance that he could not shut it.",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 493.775,
      "end": 497.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now my son, Laman, and also Lemuel and Sam,",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 497.438,
      "end": 500.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also my sons who are the sons of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 500.729,
      "end": 505.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, if ye will hearken unto the voice of Nephi ye shall not perish.",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 505.599,
      "end": 507.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if ye will hearken unto him",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 507.729,
      "end": 509.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I leave unto you a blessing,",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 509.813,
      "end": 511.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even my first blessing.",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 512.211,
      "end": 514.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But if ye will not hearken unto him",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 514.713,
      "end": 516.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I take away my first blessing,",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 516.983,
      "end": 520.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even my blessing, and it shall rest upon him.",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 520.774,
      "end": 523.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, Zoram, I speak unto you:",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 523.183,
      "end": 525.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, thou art the servant of Laban;",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 525.639,
      "end": 529.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, thou hast been brought out of the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 529.72,
      "end": 534.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know that thou art a true friend unto my son, Nephi, forever.",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 535.183,
      "end": 537.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, because thou hast been faithful",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 537.964,
      "end": 540.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thy seed shall be blessed with his seed,",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 540.605,
      "end": 544.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they dwell in prosperity long upon the face of this land;",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 544.64,
      "end": 547.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and nothing, save it shall be iniquity among them,",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 548.164,
      "end": 553.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall harm or disturb their prosperity upon the face of this land forever.",
      "verse": "1:31",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 554.045,
      "end": 557.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if ye shall keep the commandments of the Lord,",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 557.987,
      "end": 563.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord hath consecrated this land for the security of thy seed with the seed of my son.",
      "verse": "1:32",
      "lineIndex": 171
    }
  ]
}